<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to decide</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εὔ. τὸ κρῖμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					397
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. [ἐστιν] ὅτι . .</span> it
			is <i>easily discerned, manifest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				272c
			</span></i>, cf. d; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκριτ᾽ ἐστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					136
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴχνη</span>
			<i>distinct</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>having a good crisis</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσιες -ώτεραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρίτως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pall.
				<u>in Hp.</u>
				2.181
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
